 "signs": [
  {
   "tile": [
    4,
    3
   ],
   "text": "Five machines, and four of them going. The warm smell of somebody else's washing, which is the smell of being indoors when you did not have to be."
  },
  {
   "tile": [
    10,
    2
   ],
   "text": "Small ads, four deep and none of them recent. ROOM TO LET. PIANO LESSONS. And underneath, in a hand that pressed hard: WILL PLAY ANYONE, ANY TIME -- and no name, and no way to reach them."
  },
  {
   "tile": [
    11,
    5
   ],
   "text": "A folding table with a board on it. Somebody has left a game half-played and gone, and the stones have been moved since by people who were not playing."
  },
  {
   "tile": [
    14,
    7
   ],
   "text": "A second board, propped against the wall where the bench does not reach. The lines have been redrawn in biro by somebody who cared and could not draw straight."
  },
  {
   "tile": [
    12,
    2
   ],
   "text": "Under the window onto Ketelsteeg. The neon over the snack window reads backwards through the glass from in here, and the tram goes past twice while you watch."
  }
